[node name="MovementPlayground" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Dev scene. Not part of any match: a flat plain, a marked 160 m straight, a jumpable staircase, a gap gauntlet with the gaps labelled in metres, two ramps, and a MovementReadout showing live and peak horizontal speed. Everything is greybox and every dimension is derived from scenes/player/default_movement_profile.tres -- jump apex 1.11 m and air time 0.636 s -- so what the geometry asks for is exactly what the profile can pay."

