[node name="Staircase" type="Node3D" parent="."]
editor_description = "Five 6 m platforms, each 0.9 m above the last. The step is 0.9 and not 1.2 because the profile's jump apex is 1.11 m: 0.9 is a step every player can make from a standstill, and the top of the stair is 4.1 m, which nothing but the stair reaches."

