[node name="GapGauntlet" type="Node3D" parent="."]
editor_description = "Six 5 m pads at a constant 1 m, with the gaps between them widening 6, 8, 10, 12, 14 m. Air time off level ground is 0.636 s at the shipped profile, so each gap is a speed gate: 6 m needs 9.4 m/s, 8 m needs 12.6, 10 m needs 15.7, 12 m needs 18.9 and 14 m needs 22.0. Clearing one tells the player what they are doing in units they can feel, which no readout can."

